OL,3,GNEWSACar rammed before men launch
OL,4,Amachete attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car was rammed by another vehicle
OL,7,Fbefore men armed with machetes attacked
OL,8,Fit, West Midlands Police said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Yardley Wood
OL,11,FRoad, Birmingham, at about 00:40 BST on
OL,12,FMonday following reports of the
OL,13,Fincident, in which the men were said to
OL,14,Fhave attacked the victim's vehicle
OL,15,Fbefore fleeing the scene.
OL,17,FThe suspected vehicle, a BMW, was
OL,18,Ftracked to the Uxbridge area before
OL,19,Fbeing stopped on the M40 by Thames
OL,20,FValley Police. No one was injured.
